-- Package-detail translations for all 36 real Maldives packages into all
-- 6 rolled-out languages (de/es/it/ru/ja/zh), powering the new
-- /{locale}/maldives/packages/[package]/ route. Title and summary are
-- generated from 7 reusable sentence templates (32 of 36 packages are
-- heavily templated fishing/Himmafushi packages) plus 4 fully unique
-- packages translated individually. short_description and description
-- both equal the translated summary, mirroring the English PackageView
-- convention where both fields derive from the single pkg.summary value.
-- body_html is unused for packages (kept empty). Already applied directly
-- against the live DB; this migration keeps a from-scratch replay in sync.
on conflict (entity_id, locale) do update set
  slug = excluded.slug, title = excluded.title, short_description = excluded.short_description, description = excluded.description,
  body_html = excluded.body_html, meta_title = excluded.meta_title, meta_description = excluded.meta_description,
  translation_status = excluded.translation_status, translated_by = excluded.translated_by, updated_at = now();
